    "For $f(x) = (x_1 - 3)^2 + (x_2 - 2)^2$:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Gradient ($\\nabla f$): $\\begin{bmatrix} 2(x_1 - 3) \\\\ 2(x_2 - 2) \\end{bmatrix}$\n",
    "\n",
    "- Hessian ($H$): $\\begin{bmatrix} 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 \\end{bmatrix}$"
